        <h2>Founded by Australians, for Australians.</h2>
        <p>United Credit Bank began in 1984 when a group of 47 Sydneysiders pooled their savings into a community credit union. They believed banking should put people before profits — and that belief still guides everything we do today.</p>
        <p>Four decades later, we serve over 250,000 customers across Australia with 58 branches from Hobart to Darwin. We remain proudly Australian-owned, with our headquarters still at 1 Martin Place in Sydney, where it all began.</p>
        <ul class="feature-list" style="margin-top:16px;">
          <li>Proudly Australian-owned — no overseas shareholders</li>
          <li>APRA regulated and government guaranteed (up to $250K)</li>
          <li>Profits reinvested into better rates for customers</li>
          <li>Committed to net-zero carbon by 2035</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="card" style="overflow:hidden;">
          <div style="aspect-ratio:4/3;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary) 0%,var(--primary-dark) 100%);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:8rem;">🏦</div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <div class="grid-3" style="margin:0;text-align:center;">
              <div>
                <div style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--primary);">1984</div>
                <div style="font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--text-light);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;">Founded</div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--primary);">250K+</div>
                <div style="font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--text-light);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;">Customers</div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--primary);">58</div>
                <div style="font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--text-light);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;">Branches</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
