    </div>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🤝</div>
        <h3>Integrity First</h3>
        <p>We do the right thing — even when no one is watching. No hidden fees, no fine print, no tricks. Just honest banking.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🌱</div>
        <h3>Sustainable Future</h3>
        <p>We're committed to funding Australia's transition to renewable energy and a sustainable economy.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">❤️</div>
        <h3>Community Focus</h3>
        <p>Every year we donate 3% of profits to Australian community organisations, from surf lifesaving to rural fire services.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🔬</div>
        <h3>Innovation</h3>
        <p>From Australia's first mobile cheque deposit to AI-powered budgeting tools — we lead with tech that works.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🏳️‍🌈</div>
        <h3>Inclusion</h3>
        <p>We're proud to be an Employer of Choice for Gender Equality and support First Nations communities through our RAP.</p>
